{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Cellveilance Demo&quot; can experience the first chapter of the game content, other features are not open, if you need to experience more rich features, please wait for the official version online.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Cellveillance&quot; is a detective drama entertainment product, you will visit the apartment every day, and the entire apartment is responsible for everything that happens in the apartment, a mysterious organization asks you to return the information of the residents, and the apartment does not seem to be as peaceful and harmless as it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You came here to pay your debts, but when staring into the abyss becomes your duty, how do you choose? In this ordinary apartment, every click to enlarge is a re-interrogation of the definition of justice, and behind every shot lies the subversive urban Rashomon. Remember not to be fooled by their appearances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427050/extras/8.png?t=1744170466\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427050/extras/4.png?t=1744170466\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427050/extras/1.png?t=1744170466\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427050/extras/9.png?t=1744170466\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427050/extras/10.png?t=1744170466\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427050/extras/15.png?t=1744170466\" /></p><p class=\"bb_par